                                <h4 class="title">Awards & Honours</h4>
                                <p>Our institution is consistently recognized for excellence in various fields, from innovative student projects to distinguished faculty achievements. The awards, accolades, and recognition reflect our unwavering commitment to academic brilliance, leadership, and holistic development. Explore our journey of accomplishments that highlight our dedication to shaping a better future.
