                            <div class="program-credit-area faq mt--50">
                                <h4 class="title">Achievements & Recognitions</h4>
                                <div class="program-accordion">
                                    <div class="accordion" id="rts-accordion">
                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                            <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseAwards" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseAwards">
                                                Institutional Awards/Ranking
                                            </button>
                                            <div id="collapseAwards" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#rts-accordion">
                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                    <p>Cisco NetAcad Excellence Award, Jan 2025, at Cisco Bengaluru Campus, during the Cisco NetAcad India Conference.</p>
                                                    <p>Best Performing Institute Award from Cisco, at the 2024 Cisco NetAcad India Conference held at Cisco Campus, Bengaluru, Feb 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>JNTUK Appreciation Award for Best Performing Institute on the occasion of JNTUK Formation Day, August 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Top Institute for Campus Life and Ranked in Diamond Band in MHW (Mental Health and Well-Being) Ranking 2024 by World Institutional Ranking, Sept 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>31st Rank in all India Level and 9th in South India in Top 100 Engineering Colleges in India-2024 by Silicon India Education Magazine.</p>
                                                    <p>Recognized as The Most Excellent Engineering Institutes in India, 2024 by the Knowledge Review Magazine.</p>
                                                    <p>Recognized as Top 10 Educational Colleges to Follow by the Inner Review Magazine, 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Recognized as an NPTEL Local Chapter Star and A rating for Jan-April 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Ecosystem Enablers-Institution (Category-performer) at Startup Jathara-2024 by AIC-Sri Krishnadevaraya University Anantapur, March 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>AAA+ Rating by Careers360 Top Engineering Colleges in India Ranking 2023 and 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Best Participating Institute award for outstanding efforts in UBA program by Regional Coordinate Institute, Andhra University, Oct 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>In NIRF India Rankings 2023, positioned in the band of 151-300 in the Innovation Category, June 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>3rd position in Top Private Engineering Institutes Ranking-AP by Times Engineering.</p>
                                                    <p>Ranked in Silver Band across India in MHW (Mental Health and Well-Being) Ranking 2023 by World Institutional Ranking, Sept 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Certificate of Appreciation for securing NAAC A+ Grade by APSCHE and JNTUK, 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Received Certificate of Appreciation for conferment of NAAC A+ Grade on the occasion of XV Formation Day of JNTUK, August 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>A rating based on performance in NPTEL Online Certification Courses for Jan-April 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Recognized as 10 Best Colleges to Work for-2023 by Silicon India Magazine.</p>
                                                    <p>All India 28th in Dataquest Top Private T-Schools Ranking 2023 and 33rd based on Employability Index, 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Best Startup Ecosystem Enabler Award under Institutions Category at 4th Annual Startup Jathara-2023 by AIC-Sri Krishnadevaraya University Anantapur, Jan 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Special Appreciation Award from Smt P. Prasanthi, IAS, Collector & District Magistrate, West Godavari, A.P., Jan 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>In National Institutional Ranking Framework (NIRF), stood in Rank band of 251-300 in NIRF-2022, NIRF-2021, NIRF-2020.</p>
                                                    <p>All India 33rd Rank in AICTE-EduSkills Virtual Internship Annual Ranking 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Winner in AICTE FIT INDIA Challenge Category-II (Two students got the awards) and Category-III (Institutional Award), June 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Excellence in Holistic Education for Next Generation Award from the Times Business Awards, Andhra Pradesh, 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>In Atal Ranking of Institutions on Innovation Achievements (ARIIA), stood in BAND-PERFORMER in ARIIA-2021 and BAND-A (between 6th to 25th) in ARIIA-2020.</p>
                                                    <p>Best Engineering College Award from Times Business Awards 2021.</p>
                                                    <p>Perennial Award of 1.75 Lakhs under Unnat Bharat Abhiyan (UBA) of MHRD, Govt. of India, 2021.</p>
                                                    <p>Best Engineering College Award from Times Business Awards-2021.</p>
                                                    <p>2nd in Top 10 Private Engineering Institutes Ranking-2020 Andhra Pradesh by Times Engineering.</p>
                                                    <p>38th Rank in Top T-Schools (Private)-2020 ranking from DataQuest.</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                            <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseAchievements" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseAchievements">
                                                Management/Staff Achievements
                                            </button>
                                            <div id="collapseAchievements" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#rts-accordion">
                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                    <p>Sri S.R.K. Nishant Varma, Secretary cum Correspondent received Young Visionary Leadership in Engineering Education of the year 2024 by TIMES Business Awards, A.P., Sept. 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Sri S.R.K. Nishant Varma, Secretary cum Correspondent received Young Eduprenuer Award of the year 2023 by TIMES Business Awards, A.P., 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Sri Sagi Prasad Raju, the President, SRKR Engineering College, received Lifetime Achievement Award from Bharat Education Excellence Awards, 2021-22.</p>
                                                    <p>Sri S.R.K. NishantVarma, the then CEO, SRKREC, received the Best CEO Award from Nature Science Foundation, 2021-22.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. M. Jagapathi Raju, Director received Life Time Achievement Award by Artificial Intelligence Medical and Engineering Researchers Society at CMR Technical Campus, Hyderabad, March 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. Nandyala Siva Kishan, Asst. Professor of Civil Engineering received Best Startup Ecosystem Enabler Award under Individual Category at SKU, Anantapur, March 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Three faculty members Dr. T.V. Hyma Lakshmi, Associate Professor of ECE; Mr. K. Pavan Kumar, Asst. Professor of EEE and Mr. M. Suneel, Asst. Professor of Civil Engineering got NPTEL Discipline Star for Jan-April 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. Nandyala Siva Kishan got NPTEL Domain Scholar, NPTEL Believer and NPTEL Motivated Learner for Jan-April 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. T. Rambabu, Associate Professor received Best Coordinator Award for outstanding efforts in Unnat Bharat Abhiyan program by Regional Coordinate Institute, Andhra University, Oct. 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. N.G.K. Murthy, Professor & Head, Technology Centre received Best Startup Ecosystem Enabler Award under Individual Category at 4th Annual Startup Jathara-2023 by AIC, Sri Krishnadevaraya University Anantapur, Jan 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. N.G.K. Murthy received Certificate of Appreciation for his Instrumental Role as SPOC for the SWAYAM NPTEL Local Chapter for Jan-April 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. B. Bhagya Prasad, Asst. Professor of ECE got the award of NPTEL Discipline Star for Jan-Apr 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. T. Vamsi Naga Raju, Asst. Professor of Civil Engineering, received Young Researcher Award-2022 from University Institute of Technology (UIT), Himachal Pradesh University, Shimla, 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. K.R. Satyanarayana, Dean (T&P) received TPO Innovation Leader of the Year 2022 from Maharashtra TPO Association.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. M. JagapathiRaju received the Best College Principal Award from Nature Science Foundation, 2021-22.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. K.R. Satyanarayana received Niyukti Acharya Award from Bharat Education Excellence Awards, 2021-22.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. T. Vamsi Naga Raju received the Best Paper Presentation Award at an International Conference, China, July 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. K. Brahma Raju got elected as a National Council Member of the Institution of Engineers (India), Nov. 2021.</p>
                                                    <p>Prof. DVR Mohan received ATAL Best Project Award for the project 3-Dimensional Laser Engraved Design at AICTE IDEA Lab workshop, Sept. 2021.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. N. Udaya Kumar received SWAYAM-NPTEL Domain Scholar Certificate in Communication and Signal Processing, July-Dec 2021.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. K. Pavan Kumar received the Certificate of Appreciation for being recognized as NPTEL Discipline Star Award, July-Dec 2021.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. P. Raju received the International Engineering Educator degree from IGIP Austria, Jan 2021.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. M. Jagapathi Raju was nominated as a Member of APEAMCET Admission Committee-2020.</p>
                                                    <p>Dr. N. Udaya Kumar recognized as Discipline Star by NPTEL for the certification courses of same discipline, 2020.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. T. Vamsi Naga Raju received the Young Geotechnical Engineer Award-2020.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. P. Jagadeesh received the Adarsh Vidya Saraswathi Rashtriya Puraskar from Global Management Council, Ahmedabad, Dec. 2020.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. M. Suneel received the Best Paper Award at the International Conference on Sustainable Systems and Structures, MVGR College, Vizianagaram, Nov. 2019.</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        
                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                            <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseStudentAchievements" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseStudentAchievements">
