                                            </button>
                                            <div id="collapseStudentAchievements" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#rts-accordion">
                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                    <p>The team Markenyandeya won Best Design Award with cash prize of Rs. 15000/- at AITAMs Go-Karting Championship, Aditya Institute of Technology & Management, Tekkali, Srikakulam, Feb 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Won First position with 10000 cash prize in International Project Expo Conducted by IEEE and Sasi Institute of Technology and Engineering, Tadepalligudem, Feb 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Two Ideas got selected for a financial grant of Rs. 20.15 Lakh under MSME Idea Hackathon 3.0 (Women) Scheme.</p>
                                                    <p>SRKR Team received 3rd Prize at Yukti Innovation Challenge-2023 under SCRO Region by Ministry of Education’s Innovation Cell (MIC), KL University, Vijayawada, Jan 2024.</p>
                                                    <p>Ms. Amudalapalli Jaya Sri of 4th Year CSE won First Place in Mastor Orator Championship, International Toastmasters in ISB Hyderabad, October 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. KNS Pandu Ranga Rao of ECE received four Awards for Best Actor for Hero & Heroine, Best Cinematography, Best Crime Thriller Story Award for the Short Film Mahasu at National Level Short-Film Competitions, 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Mechanical students won the Runner-Up position at Formula Off Road Mini Baja India (FOMBI-23) organized at Bhopal, August 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>Ms. N. Joshita of ECE won Runner-up position and a cash award of Rs. 30,000/- at National Level Engineering Equity Hackathon organized by Virtusa, April 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>A team of CSG students Ch. Ravi Kumar, Ch. Anusha and P. Chaitanya Sryjana won at Start-Up Expo conducted by NIT-AP, February 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>A team of ECE & EEE students won at Start-Up Expo conducted by NIT-AP, February 2023.</p>
                                                    <p>At IBM Hack Challenge-2022, students won Jury Award and SRKR received the Top Contributing Institution Award.</p>
                                                    <p>SRKR Team won in Smart India Hackathon (SIH)-2022 Grand Finale and received a cash award of Rs. 1 Lakh held at D.Y. Patil College of Engineering, Pune, 25-26 August 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>SRKR Team secured Award of Appreciation in Smart India Hackathon (SIH)-2022 Grand Finale, held at Manipal University, Jaipur, 25-26 August 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Ms. P. Lakshmi Pranathi of CSE received financial grant of Rs. 15.0 lakhs for her idea of Innovation Smart Vision under MSME Innovation Scheme, July 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. Bhamaidipati V N S S S R Maheedhar of ECE received financial grant of Rs. 8.0 lakhs for his idea of Innovation Drones In Disaster Management under MSME Innovation Scheme, July 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. Vendra Sri Venkata Veeranna Neelesh of Mechanical Engineering received financial grant of Rs. 3.50 lakhs for his idea of Innovation Underwater Drone for Welding under MSME Innovation Scheme, July 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Mr. Geddam Kumar Babu & Mr. Panthagani Norise Swamy Kiran of Mechanical Engineering students are National Winners in the Category-II of AICTE FIT INDIA CHALLENGE-2021, June 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Four students S Vinaya Kumar, Y Sai Teja Sri, K Harsha, and Md Sabiha have been selected as University Innovation Fellows (UIF) and attended Stanford University Silicon Valley Meet Up held at Silicon Valley USA, March 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>Mechanical Engineering Students won 3rd place at State Level Student Innovation Competition held at Adhikavi Nannaya University for the innovation Automated Hydraulic Wheel Chair, March 2022.</p>
                                                    <p>SRKR Team Shramiks secured First Place at AICTE Chhatra Viswakarma Awards 2020.</p>
                                                    <p>In AICTE Smart India Hackathon 2020, SRKR team got selected for first prize in Ministry of Textiles Problem statement and won one lakh rupees prize money.</p>
                                                    <p>TEAM TESLA represented SRKR Engineering College at India's biggest Motor-sport event SAE INDIA e-BAJA 2020 and won 1st prize in the category of TECHNOLOGY INNOVATION.</p>
                                                    <p>The Mechanical Engineering Project Jatayu guided by Dr. K. Sita Rama Raju received one lakh cash prize in Future Plus Competition conducted by Byrraju Foundation (State Level), Sept 2020.</p>
                                                    <p>Achieved 3 awards: Droncharya Award for Best Faculty, 1st in CAE Endurance and Special Award for only Lady Driver in the Entire Event in the event Rally Car Design Challenge (RCDC) organized in Bikaner, Rajasthan, October 2019.</p>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
